' Boriel BASIC (beta): Boriel's ZX BASIC compiler, which comes with Klive.
'
' Build options go in this header, one per line, as '@name value. For example:
'@optimize 0
'@heap-size 4768

print at 10,5; paper 4; bright 0; "Welcome to Klive IDE"
print at 11,5; paper 4; bright 1; "  (Boriel's Basic)  "

' When the program ends, 128 BASIC's editor takes the screen back. So it waits here.
DO
LOOP
